{% comment %}
  Renders a header drawer menu for mobile and desktop.

  Usage:
  {% render 'header-drawer' %}
{% endcomment %}

            {%- comment -%}
              The fallbacks are assigned here rather than written as filters on the
              render arguments below. Shopify parses {% render %} attributes with a
              regex that accepts a variable or a literal and nothing more, so a
              "| default: ..." inside the tag is never applied — it is read as another
              attribute and dropped. The url settings carry no default of their own
              (Shopify's url type cannot have one), so that left every link empty,
              has_items false, and the whole dropdown rendering nothing.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign ts_url_1 = section.settings.hp_group_1_url | default: '/pages/shop-by-style'
              assign ts_url_2 = section.settings.hp_group_2_url | default: '/pages/shop-by-colour'
              assign ts_url_3 = section.settings.hp_group_3_url | default: '/pages/shop-by-occasion'
            -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Captured rather than rendered in place, so the group can be echoed
              wherever the merchant wants it to sit in the nav. The Shopify menu's
              own items are store data and can only be ordered in the admin; this
              one belongs to the theme, so its position is a setting.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- capture hp_group_html -%}
            {% render 'hp-nav-group',
              variant: 'drawer',
              label: section.settings.hp_group_label,
              scheme: section.settings.menu_color_scheme,
              i1_label: section.settings.hp_group_1_label,
              i1_url: ts_url_1,
              i2_label: section.settings.hp_group_2_label,
              i2_url: ts_url_2,
              i3_label: section.settings.hp_group_3_label,
              i3_url: ts_url_3
            %}
            {%- endcapture -%}

<header-drawer data-breakpoint="{% if section.settings.menu_type_desktop == 'drawer' %}desktop{% else %}tablet{% endif %}">
  <details id="Details-menu-drawer-container" class="menu-drawer-container">
    <summary
      class="header__icon header__icon--menu header__icon--summary link focus-inset"
      aria-label="{{ 'sections.header.menu' | t }}"
    >
      <span>
        {{- 'icon-hamburger.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        {{- 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
      </span>
    </summary>
    <div id="menu-drawer" class="gradient menu-drawer motion-reduce color-{{ section.settings.menu_color_scheme }}">
      <div class="menu-drawer__inner-container">
        <div class="menu-drawer__navigation-container">
          <nav class="menu-drawer__navigation">
            <ul class="menu-drawer__menu has-submenu list-menu" role="list">
              {%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
                {%- if forloop.index == section.settings.hp_group_position -%}{{ hp_group_html }}{%- endif -%}
                <li>
                  {%- if link.links != blank -%}
                    <details id="Details-menu-drawer-menu-item-{{ forloop.index }}">
                      <summary
                        id="HeaderDrawer-{{ link.handle }}"
                        class="menu-drawer__menu-item list-menu__item link link--text focus-inset{% if link.child_active %} menu-drawer__menu-item--active{% endif %}"
                      >
                        {{ link.title | escape }}
                        <span class="svg-wrapper">
                          {{- 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                        <span class="svg-wrapper">
                          {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                        </span>
                      </summary>
                      <div
                        id="link-{{ link.handle | escape }}"
                        class="menu-drawer__submenu has-submenu gradient motion-reduce"
                        tabindex="-1"
                      >
                        <div class="menu-drawer__inner-submenu">
                          <button class="menu-drawer__close-button link link--text focus-inset" aria-expanded="true">
                            <span class="svg-wrapper">
                              {{- 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                            </span>
                            {{ link.title | escape }}
                          </button>
                          <ul class="menu-drawer__menu list-menu" role="list" tabindex="-1">
                            {%- for childlink in link.links -%}
                              <li>
                                {%- if childlink.links == blank -%}
                                  <a
                                    id="HeaderDrawer-{{ link.handle }}-{{ childlink.handle }}"
                                    href="{{ childlink.url }}"
                                    class="menu-drawer__menu-item link link--text list-menu__item focus-inset{% if childlink.current %} menu-drawer__menu-item--active{% endif %}"
                                    {% if childlink.current %}
                                      aria-current="page"
                                    {% endif %}
                                  >
                                    {{ childlink.title | escape }}
                                  </a>
                                {%- else -%}
                                  <details id="Details-menu-drawer-{{ link.handle }}-{{ childlink.handle }}">
                                    <summary
                                      id="HeaderDrawer-{{ link.handle }}-{{ childlink.handle }}"
                                      class="menu-drawer__menu-item link link--text list-menu__item focus-inset"
                                    >
                                      {{ childlink.title | escape }}
                                      <span class="svg-wrapper">
                                        {{- 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                                      </span>
                                      <span class="svg-wrapper">
                                        {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                                      </span>
                                    </summary>
                                    <div
                                      id="childlink-{{ childlink.handle | escape }}"
                                      class="menu-drawer__submenu has-submenu gradient motion-reduce"
                                    >
                                      <button
                                        class="menu-drawer__close-button link link--text focus-inset"
                                        aria-expanded="true"
                                      >
                                        <span class="svg-wrapper">
                                          {{- 'icon-arrow.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                                        </span>
                                        {{ childlink.title | escape }}
                                      </button>
                                      <ul
                                        class="menu-drawer__menu list-menu"
                                        role="list"
                                        tabindex="-1"
                                      >
                                        {%- for grandchildlink in childlink.links -%}
                                          <li>
                                            <a
                                              id="HeaderDrawer-{{ link.handle }}-{{ childlink.handle }}-{{ grandchildlink.handle }}"
                                              href="{{ grandchildlink.url }}"
                                              class="menu-drawer__menu-item link link--text list-menu__item focus-inset{% if grandchildlink.current %} menu-drawer__menu-item--active{% endif %}"
                                              {% if grandchildlink.current %}
                                                aria-current="page"
                                              {% endif %}
                                            >
                                              {{ grandchildlink.title | escape }}
                                            </a>
                                          </li>
                                        {%- endfor -%}
                                      </ul>
                                    </div>
                                  </details>
                                {%- endif -%}
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </details>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <a
                      id="HeaderDrawer-{{ link.handle }}"
                      href="{{ link.url }}"
                      class="menu-drawer__menu-item list-menu__item link link--text focus-inset{% if link.current %} menu-drawer__menu-item--active{% endif %}"
                      {% if link.current %}
                        aria-current="page"
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {{ link.title | escape }}
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}

              {%- comment -%}
                The "Table Stories" group, the same one the desktop nav shows.
                It replaced the two loose "Shop by …" shortcut pills that used
                to sit here: those were phone-only and covered two of these
                three, so keeping both would have listed the same links twice.
              {%- endcomment -%}


              {%- comment -%}
                0, or a number past the end of the menu, puts it last.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- if section.settings.hp_group_position == 0 or section.settings.hp_group_position > section.settings.menu.links.size -%}
                {{ hp_group_html }}
              {%- endif -%}

            </ul>
          </nav>
          <div class="menu-drawer__utility-links">
            {%- comment -%}
              Trimmed deliberately. Dawn puts the account link, the country and
              language pickers and the full social row in this strip; on a phone
              that is a wall of secondary controls under the nav. The store has
              one storefront language and currency, accounts are not part of how
              people buy here, and Instagram is the only channel the brand posts
              to — so the strip carries Instagram alone.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if settings.social_instagram_link != blank -%}
              <ul class="list list-social list-unstyled" role="list">
                <li class="list-social__item">
                  <a href="{{ settings.social_instagram_link }}" class="list-social__link link">
                    <span class="svg-wrapper">
                      {{- 'icon-instagram.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                    </span>
                    <span class="visually-hidden">{{ 'general.social.links.instagram' | t }}</span>
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ul>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>
</header-drawer>
